      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T20:20:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe we rename this on BazelTest to be something like test_config (with the first config being build_config)?\n\nWe would probably be able to remove cross from BazelBuild also, right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2342,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 2342,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "b6896cb52de7b54d33c207ea5038beae34cc5e3d",
