    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ebff39db_72176abc",
        "filename": "infra/bots/gen_tasks_logic/gen_tasks_logic.go",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 2342,
      "author": {
        "id": 10009
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T21:21:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe `device_specific_config` rather than `test_config`, for consistency with the language used in the Go code?\n\nMany test drivers take a `--cross` flag. I don\u0027t think we use those flags today. Can we delete flag `--cross` from all task drivers?\n\nMore generally, what about the concept of \"cross platform\", as mentioned on line 2353 below? Can that be deleted as well?",
      "parentUuid": "ec7a201b_3ec7323e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2342,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 2342,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "b6896cb52de7b54d33c207ea5038beae34cc5e3d",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
