      "lineNbr": 2342,
      "author": {
        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T21:29:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s go with something more general `test_config` over `device_specific_config` in case we need to use it for something else (e.g. if we need to skip tests).\n\nYes, I bet we can delete --cross from everywhere",
