        "uuid": "007ab22d_510f343a",
        "filename": "infra/bots/jobs.json",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 55,
      "author": {
        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T21:29:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggested `on_rpi` because the task name reads better to me: `BazelTest...android_math_test-for_android_arm64-on_rpi...`\n\nIt makes it more clear that we are not compiling the task *for* a rpi. Eventually we can perhaps use `on_linux_rbe` to emphasize that point elsewhere.\n\nIf you disagree, that\u0027s fine, just wanted to make the rationale more clear, since task names are what our users tend to consume.",
      "parentUuid": "f9bc2d16_17c4ed7f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 55,
        "startChar": 75,
        "endLine": 55,
        "endChar": 86
      },
      "revId": "b6896cb52de7b54d33c207ea5038beae34cc5e3d",
